      "pos_start_est": 5
    },
    {
      "node_id": 1,
      "seq_id": 0,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": ", usually to be kept as ",
      "n_tokens_est": 6,
      "pos_start_est": 6
    },
    {
      "node_id": 1,
      "seq_id": 0,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "pets",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 12
    },
    {
      "node_id": 1,
      "seq_id": 0,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": ", or work on farms or for the ",
      "n_tokens_est": 8,
      "pos_start_est": 13
    },
    {
      "node_id": 1,
      "seq_id": 0,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "police",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 21
    },
    {
      "node_id": 1,
      "seq_id": 0,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": ". Some dogs are trained to be rescue dogs and join teams such as mountain rescue.",
      "n_tokens_est": 17,
      "pos_start_est": 22
    },
    {
      "node_id": 1,
      "seq_id": 0,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "</p>",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 39
    },
    {
      "node_id": 1,
      "seq_id": 0,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "<p>",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 43
    },
    {
      "node_id": 1,
      "seq_id": 0,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "Dogs have been bred by ",
      "n_tokens_est": 5,
      "pos_start_est": 46
    },
    {
      "node_id": 1,
      "seq_id": 0,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "humans",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 51
    },
    {
      "node_id": 1,
      "seq_id": 0,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " from ancestral wolves. They were the first animals to live with humans.",
      "n_tokens_est": 14,
      "pos_start_est": 52
    },
    {
      "node_id": 1,
      "seq_id": 0,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " There was a lot of different types among wolves in the Late ",
      "n_tokens_est": 12,
      "pos_start_est": 66
    },
    {
      "node_id": 1,
      "seq_id": 0,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "Pleistocene",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 78
    },
    {
      "node_id": 1,
      "seq_id": 0,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": ".",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 79
    },
    {
      "node_id": 1,
      "seq_id": 0,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "</p>",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 80
    },
    {
      "node_id": 1,
      "seq_id": 0,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "<p>",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 84
    },
    {
      "node_id": 1,
      "seq_id": 0,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "Today, some dogs are used as pets, and others are used to help humans do their work. They are popular pets because they are usually playful, friendly, loyal, and listen to humans. Thirty million dogs in the ",
      "n_tokens_est": 44,
      "pos_start_est": 87
    },
    {
      "node_id": 1,
      "seq_id": 0,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "United States",
      "n_tokens_est": 2,
      "pos_start_est": 131
    },
    {
      "node_id": 1,
      "seq_id": 0,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " have been ",
      "n_tokens_est": 2,
      "pos_start_est": 133
    },
    {
      "node_id": 1,
      "seq_id": 0,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "registered",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 135
    },
    {
      "node_id": 1,
      "seq_id": 0,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " as ",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 136
    },
    {
      "node_id": 1,
      "seq_id": 0,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "pets",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 137
    },
    {
      "node_id": 1,
      "seq_id": 0,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": ".",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 138
    },
    {
      "node_id": 1,
      "seq_id": 0,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " Dogs eat both ",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 139
    },
    {
      "node_id": 1,
      "seq_id": 0,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "meat",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 142
    },
    {
      "node_id": 1,
      "seq_id": 0,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " and ",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 143
    },
    {
      "node_id": 1,
      "seq_id": 0,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "vegetables",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 144
    },
    {
      "node_id": 1,
      "seq_id": 0,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": ", which are often mixed together and sold in stores as ",
      "n_tokens_est": 11,
      "pos_start_est": 145
    },
    {
      "node_id": 1,
      "seq_id": 0,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "dog food",
      "n_tokens_est": 2,
      "pos_start_est": 156
    },
    {
      "node_id": 1,
      "seq_id": 0,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": ".",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 158
    },
    {
      "node_id": 1,
      "seq_id": 0,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " Dogs often have jobs including police dogs, army dogs, assistance dogs, fire dogs, messenger dogs, hunting dogs, herding dogs, or rescue dogs. A baby dog is called a ",
      "n_tokens_est": 36,
      "pos_start_est": 159
    },
    {
      "node_id": 1,
      "seq_id": 0,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "pup",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 195
    },
    {
      "node_id": 1,
      "seq_id": 0,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " or ",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 196
    },
    {
      "node_id": 1,
      "seq_id": 0,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "puppy",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 197
    },
    {
      "node_id": 1,
      "seq_id": 0,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": ".",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 198
    },
    {
      "node_id": 1,
      "seq_id": 0,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "</p>",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 199
    },
    {
      "node_id": 1,
      "seq_id": 0,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "<p>",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 203
    },
    {
      "node_id": 1,
      "seq_id": 0,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "Dogs are sometimes known as \"human's best friend\" because they are kept as pets, are usually loyal, and like being around humans.",
      "n_tokens_est": 29,
      "pos_start_est": 206
    },
    {
      "node_id": 1,
      "seq_id": 0,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "</p>",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 235
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "<h2>",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 239
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "Appearance and behaviour",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 242
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "</h2>",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 245
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "<p>",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 249
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "Dogs can smell and hear better than humans but cannot see in full ",
      "n_tokens_est": 13,
      "pos_start_est": 252
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "color",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 265
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": ". Due to the structure of their eyes, dogs can see better in low light than humans. They also have a larger field of vision.",
      "n_tokens_est": 28,
      "pos_start_est": 266
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "</p>",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 294
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "<p>",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 298
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "Like wolves, wild dogs travel in groups called ",
      "n_tokens_est": 9,
      "pos_start_est": 301
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "packs",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 310
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": ". A dog in a group helps and cares for others.",
      "n_tokens_est": 12,
      "pos_start_est": 311
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "</p>",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 323
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "<h2>",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 327
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "Lifespan of dogs",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 330
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "</h2>",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 333
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "<p>",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 337
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "Different dog breeds have different lifespans. In general, smaller dogs live longer than bigger ones.",
      "n_tokens_est": 18,
      "pos_start_est": 340
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " The size and the breed of the dog change how long the dog lives on average. Breeds such as the ",
      "n_tokens_est": 21,
      "pos_start_est": 358
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "Dachshund",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 379
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " usually live for fifteen years, ",
      "n_tokens_est": 6,
      "pos_start_est": 380
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "Chihuahuas",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 386
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " can reach the age of twenty. On the other hand, the ",
      "n_tokens_est": 13,
      "pos_start_est": 387
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "Great Dane",
      "n_tokens_est": 2,
      "pos_start_est": 400
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " has an average lifespan of six to eight years; some Great Danes have lived for as long as ten years. An American Bulldog lives for around 15 years. Bigger dogs will have shorter lives than smaller dogs because of the pressure on its heart to move around.",
      "n_tokens_est": 51,
      "pos_start_est": 402
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "</p>",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 453
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "<h2>",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 457
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "Anatomy",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 460
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "</h2>",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 461
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "<h3>",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 465
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "Size and skeleton",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 468
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "</h3>",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 471
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "<p>",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 475
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "Dogs come in a wide range of sizes, from very large breeds like the ",
      "n_tokens_est": 15,
      "pos_start_est": 478
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "Great Dane",
      "n_tokens_est": 2,
      "pos_start_est": 493
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " weighing 50-79 ",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 495
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "kg",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 499
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " and measuring 71-81 cm, to very small breeds like the ",
      "n_tokens_est": 13,
      "pos_start_est": 500
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "Chihuahua",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 513
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " weighing 0.5-3 kg and measuring 13-20 cm.",
      "n_tokens_est": 14,
      "pos_start_est": 514
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " There are variations in the skeletal structure among different types of dogs.",
      "n_tokens_est": 13,
      "pos_start_est": 528
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " The dog's ",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 541
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "skeleton",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 545
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " is well-suited for running, with ",
      "n_tokens_est": 8,
      "pos_start_est": 546
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "neck",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 554
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " and back vertebrae having extensions for back ",
      "n_tokens_est": 7,
      "pos_start_est": 555
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "muscles",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 562
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": ", ",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 563
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "ribs",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 564
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " providing space for the ",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 565
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "heart",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 569
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " and ",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 570
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "lungs",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 571
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": ", and flexible shoulders.",
      "n_tokens_est": 5,
      "pos_start_est": 572
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " Selective breeding over time has led to larger ",
      "n_tokens_est": 8,
      "pos_start_est": 577
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "skeletons",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 585
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " in breeds like smaller skeletons in breeds like ",
      "n_tokens_est": 8,
      "pos_start_est": 586
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "terriers",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 594
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": ".",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 595
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
