      "pos_start_est": 1178
    },
    {
      "node_id": 6,
      "seq_id": 5,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " Humans have bred dogs for specific traits to help with tasks such as guarding, herding, hunting, retrieving, and scent detection. Dogs also show different behaviors like being very social, boldness, and aggression.",
